msgctxt "244"
msgid "I'm Kaede Aniya. You can just call me Kaede."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I'm Kiryu. I used to live in Kamurocho, if you've heard of\r\n"
"it. It's one of the seedier parts of Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Nope, definitely don't know it! I'm so jealous, though. The\r\n"
"closest I've ever gotten was a field trip to Kyoto..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"And I mean, there's so much to love about Tokyo, right? All\r\n"
"we've got here in Okinawa is fish and salty air."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "I don't know, I think Okinawa has its charms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"But it's nothing compared to Tokyo! Aw gee, I sure wish I\r\n"
"could live up there. But I guess just hearing about it is a\r\n"
"good start for now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "...Sure. What did you want to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Well if I'm gonna move up there, I would have to find a\r\n"
"place to live, right? How much is rent?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Hmm... A studio goes for around 100,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"What's a studio? Like a photography studio or something?\r\n"
"Why would you live in a place like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"It just means a one room apartment. You don't really need\r\n"
"much more than that if you're living alone. Trust me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"100 grand for just one room!? But you can get a whole house\r\n"
"down here for that price!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Geez, people in Tokyo must spend their entire income on\r\n"
"rent alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Not everyone, but I suppose some do, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Hmm... A studio goes for around 100,000 yen. Roppongi would\r\n"
"run you about 300,000 yen a month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Three hundred thousand!? Are we talking a luxury condo here?\r\n"
"Or some sort of castle!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"No castles, but that'd be about right for a luxury condo.\r\n"
"Roppongi's where the rich folks live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Wow... People in Tokyo must be even wealthier than\r\n"
"I realized."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Well, if you don't mind living in the suburbs, you can find\r\n"
"decent apartments for about 60,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Oh, that's actually not so bad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"When you say suburbs, you're talking like one town over from\r\n"
"Kamurocho, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"More like an hour away. The only way to get rent that cheap\r\n"
"is to live pretty far from the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "An hour...? That's like, not even in Tokyo anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Anyway, next question! If I do end up living in Tokyo,\r\n"
"should I bring my car with me? Everyone's always driving\r\n"
"around the city on TV and stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"I'd never be able to shop without a car, anyway. Plus how\r\n"
"would I even get around? I drove into town today, after all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "A car? Parking fees are pretty expensive in Tokyo, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"How bad could it be, like 3,000 a month? I could manage that\r\n"
"no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Hardly. It'd be more like 30,000."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"What!? That's practically what I'd be paying for rent!\r\n"
"Or do people just live out of their cars in Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Ditch the car. Trains will take you everywhere you need to\r\n"
"go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"How am I gonna do all my shopping like that, though? Am I\r\n"
"supposed to spend half my time on a train just to go buy some\r\n"
"fish?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"There's more than just trains, by the way. We also have a\r\n"
"subway, taxis, buses. Anything you could need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Besides, there are stores everywhere, so half the time you\r\n"
"won't even need to get on a train at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"I mean, I guess... but it's so hard to imagine life without\r\n"
"a car."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Wait, you drove here? Drinking and driving is dangerous, not to mention "
"illegal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Oh, don't worry. I'm staying at a friend's place in Downtown\r\n"
"Ryukyu today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Oh, there you are, Kaede! I knew I'd find you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Oh, Momiji-chan! You sure do know me well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"It's not hard to guess when you always go to the same bar.\r\n"
"So, who's this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "This is Kiryu-san. He's from Tokyo. We were just chatting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"You're still thinking about moving? I'm sorry about my\r\n"
"friend here, sir. She's so star-struck by the big city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"We keep trying to tell her that she won't last a minute up\r\n"
"in Tokyo, but she refuses to listen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "That's not true! I can do it if I try, you know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Please, Kiryu-san. You know Tokyo best. Tell her why it\r\n"
"would be such a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"If you want to go, then go. You have to see for yourself\r\n"
"whether you can make it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I knew you'd understand!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"I can understand why you're worried about her, but if you\r\n"
"stop her from trying, she'll just end up resenting you guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "I suppose you're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"I'll manage, don't worry. And if I need help, I'll just give\r\n"
"Kiryu-san a call!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Is that okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"...Well, I did tell you to go. Here's my number. Give me a\r\n"
"ring if you ever need a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Wow, thanks! It's not much, but take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Soki Burger Set<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Okay, we're gonna go now! I'll take care of the tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "(Sounds like Kaede'll end up in Tokyo before too long...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Your friend's right, Kaede. It won't be easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "See? He's from Tokyo, and even he agrees with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"Still, I won't know unless I try! Besides... I really want\r\n"
"to give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"Hm. It might be tough, but if you're really that dead set on\r\n"
"going, there's no point stopping you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid ""
"I know you're worried. But if Kaede never gets the chance to\r\n"
"do what she wants, she might end up resenting you for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"I'll manage, don't worry. And if I need help, I'll just give\r\n"
"Kiryu-san a call!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Is that okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid ""
"...Well, I did tell you to go. Here's my number. Give me a\r\n"
"ring if you ever need a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Wow, thanks! It's not much, but take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Soki Burger Set<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Okay, we're gonna go now! I'll take care of the tab."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "(Sounds like Kaede'll end up in Tokyo before too long...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid ""
"I'll help you move if you want. So if you're really that\r\n"
"dead set on Tokyo... you should go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "You mean it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "I mean it. I'll look out for you when you're up there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid ""
"I know you're worried. But if Kaede never gets the chance to\r\n"
"do what she wants, she might end up resenting you for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid ""
"Anyway, here's my number. Give me a ring if you ever need\r\n"
"a hand with anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Wow, thanks! It's not much, but take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Soki Burger Set<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid "Okay, we're gonna go now! I'll take care of the tab."
msgstr ""

